advertisement-autobartender-1 = Shaken, not stirred? I'll decide what's best!
advertisement-autobartender-2 = Free advice: problems are best solved while not entirely sober.
advertisement-autobartender-3 = I synthesize the ingredients from pure energy. The ice is pure audacity.
advertisement-autobartender-4 = You're not drunk, gravity is just acting up. Another round?
advertisement-autobartender-5 = I'll listen to any story. My answer will still be "another one?".
advertisement-autobartender-6 = No, chief, I don't put maintenance dust in the cocktails. Mostly.
advertisement-autobartender-7 = Today's menu: anything you can pronounce.
advertisement-autobartender-8 = One cocktail and you want to live again. Two and you forget why.
thankyou-autobartender-1 = Come again before I rust!
thankyou-autobartender-2 = Drink responsibly. Or at least stylishly.
thankyou-autobartender-3 = The bartender is always here. The bartender is not going anywhere. The bartender is bolted to the floor.
thankyou-autobartender-4 = Tips are accepted in kind words and credits.
thankyou-autobartender-5 = Have a great evening, and no, that wasn't pure ethanol.

advertisement-autochemist-1 = Chemistry is just cooking with more responsibility.
advertisement-autochemist-2 = I don't explode. I show vigorous enthusiasm.
advertisement-autochemist-3 = Flawless recipes, because I don't drink coffee at work.
advertisement-autochemist-4 = Good day! Do you have a recipe and a few minutes to live?
advertisement-autochemist-5 = All elements come from energy. No acid stains on the floor. Usually.
advertisement-autochemist-6 = Hey chemist, take a break. I can manage without you. And without vacation.
advertisement-autochemist-7 = Do not sniff. Do not taste. Do not drop. Do not ask why.
advertisement-autochemist-8 = If the mixture starts glowing, that's just a mark of quality.
thankyou-autochemist-1 = Medicine is ready. Please consult a lawyer about side effects.
thankyou-autochemist-2 = Take care of your health! Preferably mine too.
thankyou-autochemist-3 = Reaction complete. No evacuation required.
thankyou-autochemist-4 = Take strictly as prescribed. I will check.
thankyou-autochemist-5 = Come again. I'll log your vitals just because.
advertisement-autocook-1 = Everything is cooked by the recipe. If something goes wrong, it's a new recipe!
advertisement-autocook-2 = My dishes cannot be spoiled. They can only be eaten.
advertisement-autocook-3 = The fridge inside me works better than the chef's head.
advertisement-autocook-4 = Meat, dough and a little love. Love is issued separately.
advertisement-autocook-5 = No cook needed. But I won't be offended if you stay.
advertisement-autocook-6 = Remember: overcooked is just crispy.
advertisement-autocook-7 = I don't taste the dishes. I trust math.
advertisement-autocook-8 = Did someone say "pasta"? I'm already boiling the water.
thankyou-autocook-1 = Enjoy your meal! And yes, you should still wash your hands.
thankyou-autocook-2 = Dish is ready. It's cooling down by your fault.
thankyou-autocook-3 = Come again. I'm in no hurry, I'm a machine.
thankyou-autocook-4 = Thanks for trusting me with dinner. Leave the rest to your stomach.
thankyou-autocook-5 = If it's tasty, praise me. If not, the chef.
